# ---------- Blind Mary and the Insane Ghoul ----------
T 149 | Blind Mary, in the house south of town
A 154 | Blind Mary
C 177 | Press Skip if you never had a Bronze Tube. The Insane Ghoul (26) stands in the chapel of Tranquil Gardens Cemetery (80.9, 72.0). Kill the skeletons near the chapel first so the fight stays one on one. He is four levels above you, so your spells will often be resisted: put a Soulstone on yourself, carry a Healthstone and start at full health and mana. Send the Voidwalker in and let it hold him for a few seconds, then Corruption, Curse of Agony and Immolate, recasting what he resists, and Drain Life or the wand; keep Health Funnel on the Voidwalker. If he turns on you, use Sacrifice for the shield; do not count on Fear at this level gap. Walk away and come back later if it goes badly. He drops Mary's Looking Glass.
T 154 | Back in Darkshire: Madame Eva
A 157 | Madame Eva. The thread goes to Abercrombie in segment 11.
T 177 | Viktori Prism'Antras
A 181 | Viktori Prism'Antras. The ogre Zzarc'Vul is level 33: kept for segment 11.
A 66 | Madame Eva: The Legend of Stalvan (needs level 22)
T 66 | Clerk Daltry in the town hall
A 67 | Clerk Daltry. It sends you to Moonbrook in Westfall: kept for segment 11.
H Thelsamar | Hearthstone to Thelsamar. Next stop: the Wetlands.
